  "instructions": [
    "In a large hot pot or Dutch oven, heat the sesame oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced ginger and cook until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for another minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the chicken breast pieces and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the turmeric powder, soy sauce, and chicken broth, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Add the bok choy and cook until wilted, about 2 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the hot pot in individual bowls, garnished with chopped green onions.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
  ],
